**Costs count toward meeting the Proposition 98 minimum guarantee.

STAFF COMMENTS:  

This bill meets the criteria to be placed on the Suspense  
file.

This analysis reflects amendments that will be proposed by  
the Author at the hearing.  Author's amendments also  
include language encouraging a cooperative relationship  
between the consulting teacher and the principal and a  
number of technical changes requested by the Department of  
Finance.






































